        answer: "⦿ Define the variables:\n"
            "⦁ Let the first number be x.\n"
            "⦁ The second number is 2x.\n\n"
            "⦿ Form the equation:\n"
            "x + 2x = 81\n\n"
            "⦿ Combine like terms:\n"
            "3x = 81\n\n"
            "⦿ Find the first number:\n"
            r"x=\frac{81}{3}=27"
            "\n\n"
            "⦿ Find the second number:\n"
            "Second number = 2x\n"
            "Second number = 2(27)\n"
            "Second number = 54\n\n"
            "Answer = 54",
        explanation: "",
      ),
    ],
