            "⦿ He established schools: He set up educational structures for teaching the Holy Qur'an across all the conquered states and territories.\n"
            "⦿ He built mosques: He ordered the construction of congregational mosques in major cities, including the expansion of the Holy Mosque at Mecca and the Prophet's Mosque in Medina.\n"
            "⦿ He institutionalised public welfare financial tools: He established a public treasury (Bayt al-Mal) with a common fund for the welfare of the general public.\n"
            "⦿ He organised the standing army: He created a structured military force with regular cantonments and a registration system, ensuring soldiers were well paid and their families taken care of.",
