            "⦿ Understanding legal penalties: Teaching youth about anti-drug laws to show them that using illegal substances leads directly to police arrest, court trials, and jail time.\n"
            "⦿ Protecting marital stability: Staying completely sober to avoid financial ruin, erratic tempers, and domestic violence, which helps maintain a stable marriage.\n"
            "⦿ Respecting your body: Remembering that your physical body is a sacred temple of God, which motivates you to keep it clean and free from harmful toxins.\n"
            "⦿ Proactive parenting: Parents must closely supervise their children's activities, monitor their choice of friends, and guide them away from harmful influences.\n"
            "⦿ Providing for children's basic needs: Ensuring that children have adequate food, clothes, and shelter so they are not tempted to sell drugs or turn to vice for survival money.\n"
            "⦿ Comprehensive drug education: Launching regular anti-drug awareness campaigns in schools, churches, and on television to erase ignorance about drug risks.\n"
            "⦿ Strict law enforcement: Backing law enforcement agencies and courts to fully enforce anti-drug laws and shut down local drug supply networks.\n"
            "⦿ Exposing local drug dealers: Encouraging citizens to report drug peddlers and their hideouts to the police to keep neighborhoods safe.\n"
            "⦿ Setting a positive example as leaders: Ensuring that parents, teachers, and community leaders live sober lives so the youth have positive role models to emulate.\n"
            "⦿ Educating expectant mothers: Ensuring that prenatal clinics advise pregnant women about the severe dangers that unprescribed drugs pose to their unborn babies.\n"
            "⦿ Hosting youth workshops: Organising regular workshops and lectures by NGOs to teach young people self-control and stress management skills.\n"
            "⦿ Funding rehabilitation centers: Providing adequate public funding and trained staff to rehabilitation clinics to help recovered addicts rebuild their lives safely.\n"
            "⦿ Shunning drug users: Intentionally avoiding social circles that use drugs like cocaine or marijuana, which pressures users to reconsider their habits.\n"
