            "• (ii) Sole: only, lone, exclusive or main\n\n"
            "• (iii) Reclaim: redeem, restore, recover, salvage or replenish\n\n"
            "• (iv) Mounds: piles, heaps or hills\n\n"
            "• (v) Glittering: shining, sparkling, glistening or glistering",
